[9073]="7005B930\n1\tDestruye las estatuas de los trolls de piedra (total: 5)\030Derrota a los trolls de asedio de Gundabad (total: 3)\tDebes deshacerte de los trolls que ocupan un salón de Gundabad.\n2\tDerrota a Ghámgur Tiemblapiedra\tDebes derrotar a Ghámgur Tiemblapiedra.\n3\tReagrúpate cerca de la entrada de la cueva\tDeberías reagruparte cerca de la entrada de la cueva.\n",
[9074]="7005B931\n1\tComplete Mission: Unwelcome Guests\tYour mission is to uproot the trolls within the ancient hall in Gundabad. Speak to Ausma to travel.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[9075]="7006C134\n1\tComplete Mission: Vanished in Zahûmakh\tYour mission is to investigate Zahûmakh and attempt to find the travellers who vanished. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu\tYou have successfully aided the wounded travellers and fought off the marsh-striders! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[9076]="70072EA5\n1\tComplete Mission: Vestiges of Lâkindar\tYour mission is to go to the Quelling-house and look for any vestiges of Lâkindar's happier past that can be brought to Jiret-menêsh. Talk to Têsegi when you are ready to travel.\n2\tTalk to Têsegi in Jiret-menêsh\tYou have completed your mission of finding vestiges of Lâkindar of old and have brought them back to Jiret-menêsh. Return with the Temámir scout to report your success.\n",
[9077]="70058C72\n1\tComplete Mission: Wall of Ice\tYour mission is to clear out ice walls within the ruins of Stormwall. Speak to Hórin to travel to Stormwall.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[9078]="70058C79\n1\tDestruye muros de hielo (total: 5)\030Asegura Muro de Tormentas\tDestruye muros de hielo.\n",
[9079]="70058101\n1\tDestruye las torres de vigilancia de los trasgos (total: 10)\tDestruye las torres de vigilancia de los trasgos en el exterior de la Puerta de los Trasgos.\n",
[9080]="70058105\n1\tComplete Mission: Watch-towers at the Goblin-gate\tYour mission is to destroy the watch-towers on the path to the Goblin-gate. Speak to Ausma to travel to the Goblin-gate.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[9081]="7005871B\n1\tDerrota a estirpes de dragón en la Despensa de Scatha (total: 12)\tTu misión es derrotar a muchos estirpe de dragón que habitan en la Despensa de Scatha.\n",
[9082]="7005871C\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Bien alimentado en Wyrmsgráf'\tYour mission is to defeat many of the dragon-kind dwelling in Scatha's Larder. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Scatha's Larder.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[9083]="70058950\n1\tTu misión es repeler a los atacantes de la Horda de Escarcha y auxiliar a los enanos heridos que montan guardia en Grálinvarth.\t\n2\t¿Completado?\tTu misión es repeler a los atacantes de la Horda de Escarcha y auxiliar a los enanos heridos que montan guardia en Grálinvarth.\n3\tDerrota al engendro de Athramóth\tTu misión es repeler a los atacantes de la Horda de Escarcha y auxiliar a los enanos heridos que montan guardia en Grálinvarth.\n",
[9084]="7005896A\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Alas sobre Grálinvarth'\tYour mission is to repel the Frost-horde attackers and aid the wounded dwarves keeping watch at Grálinvarth. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Grálinvarth.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[9085]="7005A81B\n1\tComplete Mission: Wonder of the Deep\tYour mission is to protect a large geode in Gundabad from dwarf-wight miners. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[9086]="7005A828\n1\tDestruye las custodias Angmarim para detener a los espectros enanos (total: 12)\tProtege la gran geoda de los espectros enanos mineros. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n",
[9087]="70059852\n1\tIntenta rompear el hielo que sella el monte Gundabad (total: 6)\030Derrota a la Horda de la Escarcha en el monte Gundabad (total: 14)\tTu misión es repelear a la Horda de la Escarcha e intentar romper el hielo que sella las puertas del monte Gundabad.\n",
[9088]="7005985A\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: La ira del Corazónhelado'\tYour mission is to repel the Frost-horde and attempt to breach the ice sealing the gates of Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to the gates of Mount Gundabad.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
